FILE     fbloop.nc (from line 1)
DIALECT  series 0 6 10 15 16 0i 30i (Macro B at line 3)
NOTE     the output assigns variables: the DX32 needs the PPPL option (param 285 bit 4)
NOTE     loops and jumps use labels L1-L2; do not call this from a loop that uses them
NOTE     the output needs BOSS 4-7 compatibility mode off
WROTE    fbwloop.txt
NOTE     -check: dxsim: L13     WARN  feed move with no M3/M4 programmed: the spindle must already be on, or the control stops with SPINDLE NOT ON CANNOT CUT
CHECK    dxsim reads fbwloop.txt cleanly and reaches all 17 FANUC end points in order (dxsim warnings above)
RESULT   ok
